---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getPosts, postUrl } from '../lib/posts';
const recent = (await getPosts()).slice(0, 3);
---

<Base title="Page Not Found | Fifty and Unfiltered" description="That page has moved or no longer exists." noindex>
  <div class="legal" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Well, That's Awkward</div>
    <h1>That page <em>moved on</em></h1>
    <p>The site was rebuilt, and some old addresses from the previous version no longer exist. What you are looking for is probably one of these:</p>
    <p style="margin:1.5rem 0;"><a class="btn-lav" href="/blog">Go to the Blog</a> &nbsp; <a class="btn-ghost" href="/">Home</a></p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Recent posts</h2>
    <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;">
      {recent.map((p) => <li style="margin:0.5rem 0;"><a href={postUrl(p)} style="color:var(--lav-deep);text-decoration:underline;">{p.data.title}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
